   "titel": "SlimSAS plug under the neighbouring riser",
   "text": "After its 45 mm rigid plug, each cable passes just under the edge of the riser to its left (0.5 mm overlap in the model; risers are 47.8 mm apart). Check with the real plug before tightening; if needed raise the neighbouring riser by 2–3 mm (8×20 standoffs)."
  },
  {
   "titel": "Left-side overhang",
